  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Two spheres of mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"m\"></span> and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"M\"></span> are attached to two strings, A and B and hang vertically. The mass of the strings is negligible.</p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>What is the tension in A and in B?</p>\n\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Tension in A</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Tension in B</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"A\">\n<td><strong>A.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"mg\"></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"(M+m)g\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"B\">\n<td><strong>B.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"mg\"></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Mg\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"C\">\n<td><strong>C.</strong></td>\n<td>\n<p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"(M+m)g\"></span></p>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Mg\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"D\">\n<td><strong>D.</strong></td>\n<td>\n<p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"(M+m)g\"></span></p>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"(M+m)g\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
